## 19. Suggested stack pins
Use these unless the implementer has a repo-local reason to differ. Write the reason in the README.
- TypeScript everywhere
- Next.js (App Router) for `apps/web`
- Expo for `apps/mobile`
- NestJS or Hono for `apps/api` (pick one and stay with it)
- PostgreSQL + Prisma
- Zod in `packages/shared`
- Stripe
- S3-compatible storage
- Redis + a simple queue (BullMQ if Redis)
- One OpenAPI document published from the API
UI: a small component set, responsive, fast to ship. Visual direction is calm and direct: off-white background, near-black text, one accent color. The product should feel like a working tool for artists, not a nightlife flyer and not a generic SaaS template with purple gradients. Act name and next booking are the loudest elements on the artist home screen.
